{"v":[{"a":["وَٱلشَّمۡسِ","وَضُحَىٰهَا"],"t":"By the sun and its radiance","l":"Wa Ash-Shamsi Wa Đuhaha","w":[["wal-shamsi","By the sun"],["waḍuḥāhā","and its brightness"]]},{"a":["وَٱلۡقَمَرِ","إِذَا","تَلَىٰهَا"],"t":"And the moon as it follows it","l":"Wa Al-Qamari 'Idha Talaha","w":[["wal-qamari","And the moon"],["idhā","when"],["talāhā","it follows it"]]},{"a":["وَٱلنَّهَارِ","إِذَا","جَلَّىٰهَا"],"t":"And the day as it reveals it","l":"Wa An-Nahari 'Idha Jallaha","w":[["wal-nahāri","And the day"],["idhā","when"],["jallāhā","it displays it"]]},{"a":["وَٱلَّيۡلِ","إِذَا","يَغۡشَىٰهَا"],"t":"And the night as it conceals it","l":"Wa Al-Layli 'Idha Yaghshaha","w":[["wa-al-layli","And the night"],["idhā","when"],["yaghshāhā","it covers it"]]},{"a":["وَٱلسَّمَآءِ","وَمَا","بَنَىٰهَا"],"t":"And the sky and He who built it","l":"Wa As-Sama'i Wa Ma Banaha","w":[["wal-samāi","And the heaven"],["wamā","and (He) Who"],["banāhā","constructed it"]]},{"a":["وَٱلۡأَرۡضِ","وَمَا","طَحَىٰهَا"],"t":"And the earth and He who spread it","l":"Wa Al-'Arđi Wa Ma Tahaha","w":[["wal-arḍi","And the earth"],["wamā","and by (He) Who"],["ṭaḥāhā","spread it"]]},{"a":["وَنَفۡسٖ","وَمَا","سَوَّىٰهَا"],"t":"And the soul and He who proportioned it","l":"Wa Nafsin Wa Ma Sawwaha","w":[["wanafsin","And (the) soul"],["wamā","and (He) Who"],["sawwāhā","proportioned it"]]},{"a":["فَأَلۡهَمَهَا","فُجُورَهَا","وَتَقۡوَىٰهَا"],"t":"And inspired it with its wickedness and its righteousness","l":"Fa'alhamaha Fujuraha Wa Taqwaha","w":[["fa-alhamahā","And He inspired it"],["fujūrahā","(to distinguish) its wickedness"],["wataqwāhā","and its righteousness"]]},{"a":["قَدۡ","أَفۡلَحَ","مَن","زَكَّىٰهَا"],"t":"Successful is he who purifies it","l":"Qad 'Aflaha Man Zakkaha","w":[["qad","Indeed"],["aflaḥa","he succeeds"],["man","who"],["zakkāhā","purifies it"]]},{"a":["وَقَدۡ","خَابَ","مَن","دَسَّىٰهَا"],"t":"Failing is he who corrupts it","l":"Wa Qad Khaba Man Dassaha","w":[["waqad","And indeed"],["khāba","he fails"],["man","who"],["dassāhā","buries it"]]},{"a":["كَذَّبَتۡ","ثَمُودُ","بِطَغۡوَىٰهَآ"],"t":"Thamood denied in its pride","l":"Kadhabat Thamudu Bitaghwaha","w":[["kadhabat","Denied"],["thamūdu","Thamud"],["biṭaghwāhā","by their transgression"]]},{"a":["إِذِ","ٱنۢبَعَثَ","أَشۡقَىٰهَا"],"t":"When it followed its most wicked","l":"Idhi Anba`atha 'Ashqaha","w":[["idhi","When"],["inbaʿatha","(was) sent forth"],["ashqāhā","(the) most wicked of them"]]},{"a":["فَقَالَ","لَهُمۡ","رَسُولُ","ٱللَّهِ","نَاقَةَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَسُقۡيَٰهَا"],"t":"The messenger of God said to them, “This is the she-camel of God, so let her drink.”","l":"Faqala Lahum Rasulu Allahi Naqata Allahi Wa Suqyaha","w":[["faqāla","But said"],["lahum","to them"],["rasūlu","(the) Messenger"],["l-lahi","(of) Allah"],["nāqata","(It is the) she-camel"],["l-lahi","(of) Allah"],["wasuq'yāhā","and her drink"]]},{"a":["فَكَذَّبُوهُ","فَعَقَرُوهَا","فَدَمۡدَمَ","عَلَيۡهِمۡ","رَبُّهُم","بِذَنۢبِهِمۡ","فَسَوَّىٰهَا"],"t":"But they called him a liar, and hamstrung her. So their Lord crushed them for their sin, and leveled it","l":"Fakadhabuhu Fa`aqaruha Fadamdama `Alayhim Rabbuhum Bidhanbihim Fasawwaha","w":[["fakadhabūhu","But they denied him"],["faʿaqarūhā","and they hamstrung her"],["fadamdama","So destroyed"],["ʿalayhim","them"],["rabbuhum","their Lord"],["bidhanbihim","for their sin"],["fasawwāhā","and leveled them"]]},{"a":["وَلَا","يَخَافُ","عُقۡبَٰهَا"],"t":"And He does not fear its sequel","l":"Wa La Yakhafu `Uqbaha","w":[["walā","And not"],["yakhāfu","He fears"],["ʿuq'bāhā","its consequences"]]}]}